TI  - GenLink: Generation-Driven Schema-Linking via Multi-Model Learning for Text-to-SQL
AU  - Hao, Zhifeng
AU  - Huang, Junqi
AU  - Shi, Shaobin
AU  - Cai, Ruichu
AU  - Xu, Boyan
